{
  "title": "Dua for Sustenance",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّ ذُنُوْبِىْ لَمْ يَبْقَ لَهَاۤ اِلَّا رَجَاۤءُ عَفْوِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNA ZUNOOBEE LAM YABQA LAHAA ILLAA RAJAAA-O A'FWIKA\nO Allah, indeed my sins have left nothing for them except hope in Your pardon,\nوَ قَدْ قَدَّمْتُ اٰلَةَ الْحِرْمَانِ بَيْنَ يَدَىَّ\nWA QAD QADDAMTU AALATAL HIRMAANI BAYNA YADAYYA\nand I have set the tools of deprivation before myself,\nفَاَنَا اَسْئَلُكَ مَا لَاۤ اَسْتَحِقُّهُ\nFA-ANAA AS-ALUKA MAA LAA ASTAHIQQUH\nso I ask You for what I do not deserve,\nوَ اَدْعُوْكَ مَالَاۤ اَسْتَوْجِبُهُ\nWA AD-U'KA MAA LAA ASTAWJIBUH\nand I call upon You for what I have no claim to,\nوَ اَتَضَرَّعُ اِلَيْكَ بِمَا لَاۤ اَسْتَاْهِلُهُ\nWA ATADARRA-U' ILAYKA BIMAA LAA ASTA-HILUH\nand I implore You humbly for what I do not merit,\nوَ لَمْ يَخْفَ عَلَيْكَ حَالِىْ وَ اِنْ خَفِىَ عَلَى النَّاسِ كُنْهُ مَعْرِفَةِ اَمْرِىْ\nWA LAM YAKHFA A'LAYKA HAALEE WA IN KHAFIYA A'LAN NAASI KUNHA MA'RIFATI AMREE\nyet my condition is not hidden from You, even though the true nature of my affair is hidden from other people.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنْ كَانَ رِزْقِىْ فِى السَّمَاۤءِ فَاَهْبِطْهُ\nALLAAHUMMA IN KAANA RIZQEE FIS SAMAAA-I FA-AHBITH-HU\nO Allah, if my sustenance is in the sky, then bring it down,\nوَ اِنْ كَانَ فِى الْاَرْضِ فَاَظْهِرْهُ\nWA IN KAANA FIL ARDI FA-AZHIRHU\nand if it is in the earth, then bring it forth,\nوَ اِنْ كَانَ بَعِيْدًا فَقَرِّبْهُ\nWA IN KAANA BA-E'EEDAN FA-QARRIBHU\nand if it is far, then bring it near,\nوَ اِنْ كَانَ قَرِيْبًا فَيَسِّرْهُ\nWA IN KAANA QAREEBAN FA-YASSIRHU\nand if it is near, then make it easy,\nوَ اِنْ كَانَ قَلِيْلًا فَكَثِّرْهُ وَ بَارِكْ لِىْ فِيْهِ\nWA IN KAANA QALEELAN FA-KATHTHIRHU WA BAARIK LEE FEEH\nand if it is little, then increase it, and bless it for me.",
  "merits": "This supplicatory prayer, quoted from Sayyid Ibn Tawus's al-Mujtana, may also be used for purposes beyond sustenance."
}
